> ter fuel growth, instrumented with the national jet-fuel price series. All regressions include controls for income growth, population growth, inflation, a high-infla
> tion indicator, route dominance, and HHI, as well as carrier and route fixed effects. Robust standard errors are in parentheses. \(^{*}p<0.10\), \(^{**}p<0.05\), \(^
> {***}p<0.01\)." _n

